--
`static' in a lambda-specifier-seq was a parse error; the MSVC 14.51 (Visual
Studio 2026) STL uses static lambdas unconditionally, so every test including
<vector>, <string>, <numeric> or <filesystem> failed to parse on the Windows CI
runner (reproduced with the run's msvc-preprocessed-headers artifact).
